{"unit_id":"ggghhh-11__dsh-peak-hour-reminder#card-zh","repo":"ggghhh-11/dsh-peak-hour-reminder","commit":"d1fc086b1801afa1d0ff4803339c9e5f4bffdccd","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-peak-hour-reminder 是面向 DSH Web 和 Desktop 的 DeepSeek API 高峰时段提醒插件。它在模型调用前检查时段，并在高峰开始或执行中跨入高峰时向用户询问是否继续；暂停时保存进度，用户可发送“继续”恢复。它还按需联网更新中国节假日数据，并将假期和窗口状态保存在本地。适合希望控制 DeepSeek 高峰时段调用的 DSH 用户；无需 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:335-435","lib/update.js:100-181"]}
{"unit_id":"ggghhh-11__dsh-peak-hour-reminder#card-en","repo":"ggghhh-11/dsh-peak-hour-reminder","commit":"d1fc086b1801afa1d0ff4803339c9e5f4bffdccd","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-peak-hour-reminder checks DeepSeek API peak hours in DSH. It asks whether to continue when a turn starts or crosses into a peak window; paused progress can resume when the user sends “continue.” It can refresh Chinese holiday data online and stores state locally. No API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:335-435","lib/update.js:100-181"]}
