{"unit_id":"ggghhh-11__dsh-peak-hour-reminder#caveat-1","repo":"ggghhh-11/dsh-peak-hour-reminder","commit":"d1fc086b1801afa1d0ff4803339c9e5f4bffdccd","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-peak-hour-reminder 使用前须知：默认会向 timor.tech 请求节假日数据；请求只获取年份数据，插件将状态保存在本地。可通过 updateEnabled 关闭联网。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/update.js:69-100","lib/data.js:18-28","lib/peak.js:23-24"]}
